 (M 'context-window-and-output-token-metadata' `
  'getContextWindowForModel() resolves the window in a fixed precedence: settings contextWindowTokens override, then an explicit [1m] suffix (1000000), then the context-1m beta together with modelSupports1M, then the sonnet-1m experiment flag, then the 200000 default. getModelMaxOutputTokens() returns a {default, upperLimit} pair per canonical model family (Opus 4.6 64k/128k, Sonnet 4.6 32k/128k, 4.5/4/3.7 32k/64k, 3.x 4k-8k). resolveConfiguredMaxOutputTokens() clamps the settings value to the model upper limit and then applies CLAUDE_CODE_MAX_OUTPUT_TOKENS via a bounded-int env validator. The messages adapter wraps this in getMaxOutputTokensForModel(), whose slot-cap branch is inert (see inertMechanisms).' `
