 (M 'reasoning-effort-translation' `
  'Effort is a five-level string vocabulary (low|medium|high|max|xhigh) that may also arrive as an integer. resolveAppliedEffort() applies the precedence env CLAUDE_CODE_EFFORT_LEVEL, then the appState value, then the model default, treating env unset/auto as an explicit none, and DOWNGRADES max to high on any model other than Opus 4.6 on a first-party URL. The Messages adapter writes a string effort into output_config.effort and appends the effort beta header, or - for ant numeric values - into anthropic_internal.effort_override. The Responses path instead mirrors the string effort into reasoning.effort and skips numeric values entirely.' `
